          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kiteluo Yosep akekonye, koany onaeeke Benyamin, okoku loka totoke, kobala ebe, “Lo ŋes enooritikus loibalasi yesi?” Kobala ebe, “Edeke kosianik jo, ikakoku.” ",
