              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koodonok kes inyamat luajaas akonyeneke; konye aodokinet naka Benyamin kitelekarite nukee irwan akany. Komatata, kiyalamikinos kaŋes.",
